WEBVTT

00:06:28.511 --> 00:06:32.836
So there was this attitude
of "if she pulls it off, it's OK.

00:06:32.860 --> 00:06:36.437
If she fails, then, well,
she's just a young African woman

00:06:36.461 --> 00:06:38.376
whose career doesn't matter that much."

00:06:38.853 --> 00:06:40.004
From that experience,

00:06:40.028 --> 00:06:42.634
I learned things
about myself and leadership,

00:06:42.658 --> 00:06:45.353
and the biggest lesson
we can share is this:

00:06:45.377 --> 00:06:48.241
if you have a sense of purpose
that drives you,

00:06:48.265 --> 00:06:49.552
then aim high --

00:06:49.576 --> 00:06:50.860
become a leader.

00:06:51.439 --> 00:06:54.067
And make room as you go.

00:06:54.663 --> 00:06:58.634
Former US Secretary of State
Madeleine Albright is fond of saying

00:06:58.658 --> 00:07:02.842
that there's a special place in hell
for women who don't support women.